    "chunk_text": "him Adrianus se abbud mid ferde, & to eallum rehte fultemade. W\u00e6s he \u00e6rest \u00e6rcebiscopa, \u00fe\u00e6t him eall Ongolcyn hrynesse ge\u00feafode. Ond for\u00f0on heo begen w\u00e6ron ge se biscop ge se abbud, swa swa we \u00e6r cw\u00e6don, wel gel\u00e6red ge W\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t sweotol tacn, \u00fe\u00e6tte heora discipulas w\u00e6ron wel gel\u00e6rde ge in Grecisc gereorde ge in Ne w\u00e6ron her \u00e6fre, seo\u00fe\u00f0an Ongolcyn Breotone gesohte, ges\u00e6ligran tide ne f\u00e6geran. W\u00e6ron her stronge cyningas & wel cristne ond eallum ellreordum cynnum ut in miclum ege; ond Ond swa hwelce men swa swa wilnadon \u00fe\u00e6t heo in halgum leorningum tyde w\u00e6ron, heo h\u00e6fdon Swylce eac sonas to singenne in circan, \u00f0a \u00f0e o\u00f0\u00f0\u00e6t in Cent anre menn cu\u00f0on, of \u00fe\u00e6re tide Ond \u00e6rest, buton Iacobe \u00fe\u00e6m songere bi \u00fe\u00e6m we beforan \u00e6r s\u00e6gdon, w\u00e6s songes magister W\u00e6s se asponen from Cent from Wilfer\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6m arwyr\u00f0an biscope, se \u00e6rest betweoh biscopum, \u00dea ferde Theodor biscop geond ealle Ongolcynnes m\u00e6g\u00f0e, & biscopas halgode in gelimplecum Ond \u00fea \u00feing, \u00fee he unfulfremed gemette, mid heora fultume he \u00f0a rehte & bette. Betweoh \u00feon, \u00fea he Ceddan biscop mid wordum \u00fereade, \u00fe\u00e6t he rihtlice gehalgad ne w\u00e6re, \u00fea Ac for intingan hersumnesse ic haten ge\u00feafode, \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00feone had underhnah, \u00feeah \ufffd",
